..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : BELANRM.EV
.. Datum          : 19.02.2007
.. Version        : 2007r1n00
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Funktion       : Allgemeines Eventhandling
..
.. Schnittstelle (Parameter und ihre Bedeutung)
..   verwendet Arrayparameter (arg.i)          : nein
..   verwendet Namensparameter (xpname=wert)   : nein
..
.. Ablauf         :
..
.. Functionality  : central eventhandling
..
.. Interface (arguments and their meaning)
..   uses array argument (arg.i)           : no
..   uses name argument  (xpname=value)    : no
..
.. Program flow   :
...Includes       :
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.type gd xgd
..
.. ----------- ----- Events -------- -------------------------------------------
.continue TABINIT ? T|evtartengl="FIELD_EXIT"    & T|evtvar = "kanrm"
.continue ZEIT    ? T|evtartengl="FIELD_EXIT"    & T|evtvar = "kvon"
.continue TABINIT ? T|evtartengl="FIELD_EXIT"    & T|evtvar = "kbis"
.. ----------- ---------- ---------- -------------------------------------------
.continue FORBID  ? T|evtartengl = "ROW_MOVE_BEFORE"
.. ----------- ---------- ---------- -------------------------------------------
.continue
..
!ZEIT: Startdatum wurde neu eingegeben
.. start of current month
.formula U|xgd = 'M|kvon:8'<<6
.. end of current month
.formula M|kbis = U|xgd +45
.formula M|kbis = 'M|kbis:8'<<6
.formula M|kbis = M|kbis -1
.continue TABINIT
..
!TABINIT: a key field was changed, remove old rows
.make screen line -- ? M|tzeilen > 0
.continue END
..
!FORBID: an event was triggered, which is not allowed
.error
.end 1
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
